{"step_index":10929,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T14:14:53Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. Agy cli er core achoron kon kon file er upore nirvor kore?\n2. Tumi je folder structure dila eitar source dao\n3. Tomar file structure thik nei based on article\n4. Assa, tumi kono kaaj naa korei folder Structure gulo reset korar upay ki? ETA AMI e karone bollam je, Agy cli first time installation e always default settings ei thakbe......folder Structure......But Evabe uninstall korle multiple gemini commmand center toiri hote paare,...so only ektai commmand center paoar upay ki? Ebong tumi nijei kono kaaj naa kore..,..default architecture paoar upay ki\n5. Accha azure e jokhon amra agy cli install korlam, tokhon tumi ki manually files alternate korsile?\n6. Azure er folder structure visit korar jonno, live link dao....arekta prosno ei linkgulo cloudflare er madhyome dite hoy keno? Amra to vm ei acchi.......vm theke direct site live kora jay naa? Jaihok ei link ta onek kisu visible naa,,,secondly,,,Ei link taar kono ek jaygay My computer naame Logo dao....eitate ami hubohu windows 11 er interface dekhte paabo.....ebong azure er sokol files dekhte paabo.....link creation er jonno irakiroan folder er vitore alada folder create koro\n7. Ei link e cpu activity chhilo jeta delete korla\n8. https://memories-birth-outer-speeches.trycloudflare.com eta jevabe ase ovabei thakbe.......ebong file explorer o oivabei thakbe.....just 2  ta button thabe in window 11 home e....ekhane ei 2 ta button thekei dekha jabe ei 3 ta\n9. Eo dutoi irak iroan folder er oi sub folder e rakho,....and cpu er live monitoring er graph kaaj korse naa.....aar windows explorer er site ta slow\n10. Windows home e cpu buttton e click korle kisu dekhay naa\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User's Core Request:**\n  1. *\"Eo dutoi irak iroan folder er oi sub folder e rakho\"* (\"Keep both of these [Windows Explorer + Live Resource Monitor] inside the subfolder under IrakIroan directory\").\n  2. *\"and cpu er live monitoring er graph kaaj korse naa\"* (\"and the CPU live monitoring graph is not working\").\n  3. *\"aar windows explorer er site ta slow\"* (\"and the Windows explorer site is slow\").\n  4. *\"Windows home e cpu buttton e click korle kisu dekhay naa\"* (\"Clicking on the CPU button in Windows home shows nothing\").\n- **Success Criteria:**\n  - Both services/files hosted out of `/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/`.\n  - Windows Explorer site loads blazingly fast (sub-20ms).\n  - Clicking Button 2 (\"রিসোর্স ও CPU মনিটর\") immediately reveals the live monitor with working CPU & RAM charts, active cores, and process list without blank screens or iframe failures.\n  - The standalone monitor `https://memories-birth-outer-speeches.trycloudflare.com` remains fully functional with working Chart.js.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Files Consolidated in Subfolder:**\n  - Directory: [`/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer`](file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer)\n  - `server.py`: Upgraded to `ThreadingHTTPServer`, HTTP/1.1 keep-alive, in-memory caching for stats and history, local file serving for `monitor.html` and `chart.min.js`.\n  - `static/index.html`: Redesigned with 2 primary Windows 11 Home buttons; native embedding of the Live Resource Monitor DOM (NO IFRAME!), removing all white-screen/iframe bugs.\n  - `static/monitor.html`: Full copy of standalone monitor HTML with Chart.js fallback.\n  - `static/chart.min.js`: Local Chart.js v4.4.1 (201 KB).\n- **Chart.js Missing File Bug Solved:**\n  - Port 8090 was returning 404 for `/chart.min.js` because process 204399 was executing from `.webterminal`/`.local/bin`.\n  - We copied `chart.min.js` to `/home/azureuser/.local/bin/chart.min.js` and `/home/azureuser/.webterminal/chart.min.js`.\n  - Tested: `https://memories-birth-outer-speeches.trycloudflare.com/chart.min.js` now returns **HTTP 200 OK** (201 KB).\n- **Backend Caching & Threading Implemented:**\n  - Switched from single-threaded `HTTPServer` to `ThreadingHTTPServer`.\n  - Benchmark: API responses dropped from 200ms+ down to **12–15ms**.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Root Cause Analysis\n1. **Why clicking the CPU button showed nothing:**\n   - Previous implementation used an iframe `<iframe id=\"monitorIframe\" src=\"\">`. In browsers, `iframe.src` resolved to `window.location.href`, so `if (!iframe.src || iframe.src === 'about:blank')` evaluated to false. The iframe remained blank dark screen.\n   - **Fix Applied:** Replaced the iframe with **100% native DOM embedding** inside `<div class=\"monitor-view-container\" id=\"viewMonitor\">`. Clicking Button 2 toggles `display: flex` and immediately renders the monitor with zero iframe overhead.\n2. **Why the Graph was NOT displaying data:**\n   - Diagnostic discovery: Port 8090's history ring buffer only stores up to ~30 minutes of telemetry!\n   - Calling `/api/history?range=1h` or `24h` returned an **empty array `[]`**! Because default `currentRange` was `'1h'`, the chart had no data points and stayed blank.\n   - Ranges `1m`, `5m`, `15m`, `30m` all have 100+ rich data points!\n   - **Fix Applied:** In `server.py`, added auto-fallback to `range=30m` whenever a range returns empty. In `static/index.html`, set default `currentRange = '15m'` (or `'5m'`).\n3. **Why Windows Explorer was slow:**\n   - `openThisPC()` was calling `loadDrives()` AND then immediately calling `/api/browse?path=/home/azureuser`, scanning 100+ files and computing sizes on every click.\n   - Combined with single-threaded Python `HTTPServer`, every concurrent call blocked.\n   - **Fix Applied:** In `navigateTo('THIS_PC')`, it loads drives and quick workspace shortcuts and returns immediately (<10ms). ThreadingHTTPServer handles requests concurrently.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Service Ports & URLs:**\n  - Port 8088 (`azure-file-explorer.service`):\n    - Public Tunnel: `https://constraint-marion-casio-aircraft.trycloudflare.com`\n  - Port 8090 (root process 204399 + cloudflared tunnel PID 190241):\n    - Public Tunnel: `https://memories-birth-outer-speeches.trycloudflare.com`\n- **Tunnel Safety Warning:**\n  - DO NOT kill PID 190241 (`cloudflared tunnel --url http://127.0.0.1:8090`). It is a quick tunnel; restarting it will destroy the `memories-birth-outer-speeches` URL.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (In Exact Priority Order)\n1. **Update Default Range in `static/index.html`:**\n   - In `/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/static/index.html`:\n     - Ensure line has `let currentRange = '15m';` (or `'5m'`).\n     - In the pills HTML: `<button class=\"pill active\" onclick=\"changeRange('15m', this)\">15মি</button>` (remove active from `'1h'`).\n2. **Restart `azure-file-explorer.service`:**\n   - Run `systemctl --user restart azure-file-explorer.service`.\n3. **Verify Endpoints:**\n   - Run `curl -s \"http://127.0.0.1:8088/api/history?range=15m\" | head -c 100`.\n   - Run `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8088/api/stats`.\n4. **Respond to Iraq Bhai:**\n   - Address as \"ইরাক ভাইয়া\".\n   - Language: Pure Bengali script.\n   - Formatting: Single asterisks `*` only (NO `**`), clamped dividers `«──────────────────────────────»` (30-32 chars), max line length 48-50 chars.\n   - Explain clearly:\n     1. কেন আগে ব্ল্যাঙ্ক দেখাচ্ছিল (আইফ্রেম এর বদলে এখন সরাসরি নেটিভ ভিউ যোগ করা হয়েছে)।\n     2. গ্রাফ কেন কাজ করছিল না (হিস্ট্রি এপিআই-তে ১ ঘণ্টার বাফার ফাঁকা ছিল, এখন ১৫ মিনিট ডিফল্ট ও অটো-ফলব্যাক সেট করা হয়েছে এবং `chart.min.js` ফিক্স করা হয়েছে)।\n     3. উইন্ডোজ এক্সপ্লোরারের গতি এখন মিলি-সেকেন্ডে ফাস্ট।\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Address user as: \"ইরাক ভাইয়া\".\n- Language: Pure Bengali script (বাংলা লিপি).\n- Formatting: Single asterisks `*` only (NO `**`), clamped dividers `«──────────────────────────────»`.\n- Absolute file paths: `file:///home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/server.py`, etc.\n- No `sudo` execution (Hard denied by Rule 26, 27).\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 2 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: delete_proof_40_points_test_report]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/delete_proof_40_points_test_report.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T02:48:38Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: delete_proof_architecture_implementation]\nPath: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/delete_proof_architecture_implementation.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-26T02:26:43Z\n\n# Subagents\nThe following subagents were spawned during this conversation (up to 20).\nView the conversation log to see the full conversation with the subagent and use send_message with the conversation_id to communicate with them.\n\n{\n  \"spec\":  {\n    \"typeName\":  \"ask_and_research\",\n    \"role\":  \"Ask & Research Specialist\",\n    \"initialPrompt\":  \"অনুগ্রহ করে আপনার অ্যাক্টিভেশন যাচাই করুন, বর্তমান ওয়ার্কস্পেস পাথ চেক করুন এবং 'Ask & Research' সাব-এজেন্ট হিসেবে আপনার মূল দায়িত্ব ও ক্ষমতা বাংলা লিপিতে সংক্ষিপ্তভাবে রিপোর্ট করুন।\",\n    \"inherit\":  true,\n    \"model\":  \"MODEL_PLACEHOLDER_M322\",\n    \"modelTier\":  \"MODEL_TIER_FLASH\"\n  },\n  \"result\":  {\n    \"conversationId\":  \"97a12c58-ac5f-42a8-a933-07336c81795c\",\n    \"logAbsoluteUri\":  \"file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/97a12c58-ac5f-42a8-a933-07336c81795c/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl\",\n    \"workspaceUris\":  [\n      \"file:///home/azureuser\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"spawnStepIndex\":  2747\n}"}
